# Build output. The RadiusShared XCFramework is produced by Gradle from mobile/shared/
# on every build (Scripts/build-shared-framework.sh) and is NEVER committed.
#
# Committing a binary shared core would defeat the whole point of the pre-build phase:
# the repo would carry a snapshot that can silently disagree with mobile/shared/ sources.
*
!.gitignore
